{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:AppendixStandardModel.StrandTwistDatum","@type":"LeanModule","name":"AppendixStandardModel.StrandTwistDatum","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.GroupTheory.Perm.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Fintype.Perm","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":13,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.TwistDatum.Ycand_bar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.TwistDatum.Ycand_bar","kind":"theorem","line":167,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-standard-model/strand-twist-datum.lean#L167-L176","doc":"**Bar (antiparticle) consistency of the candidate**: under orientation\nreversal (`bar`, negating every twist) together with the isospin flip\n`I₃ ↦ −I₃`, the candidate hypercharge negates. The CPT-compatible sign,\ninherited from `totalTwist_bar`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.TwistDatum.totalTwist_pinned_of_Ycand","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.TwistDatum.totalTwist_pinned_of_Ycand","kind":"theorem","line":155,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-standard-model/strand-twist-datum.lean#L155-L165","doc":"**The spectrum pins the total twist, and only the total.** Reproducing a\nprescribed hypercharge `Y` against isospin `I₃` is equivalent to the total\ntwist equalling `3·(I₃ + Y/2) = 3Q` (Gell-Mann–Nishijima). Hence the SM\nfirst-generation spectrum uniquely determines each fermion's total twist;\nthe residual multiset freedom is unconstrained by `Y`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.TwistDatum.Ycand_factors_totalTwist","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.TwistDatum.Ycand_factors_totalTwist","kind":"theorem","line":147,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-standard-model/strand-twist-datum.lean#L147-L153","doc":"**The candidate hypercharge factors through the total twist**: two\nframings with equal total twist yield the same candidate hypercharge, so\n`Y_cand` cannot distinguish framings that differ only in how a fixed total\nis split across strands. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.TwistDatum.Ycand","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.TwistDatum.Ycand","kind":"def","line":141,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-standard-model/strand-twist-datum.lean#L141-L145","doc":"**Candidate hypercharge** on a framed state with writhe-derived isospin\n`I₃`: `Y = 2·(totalTwist/3 − I₃)`. The `def:strand-twist-datum`\nnormalisation `Q_twist = totalTwist/3` (helon colour-tube quantum). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.TwistDatum.exists_same_writhe_ne_totalTwist","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.TwistDatum.exists_same_writhe_ne_totalTwist","kind":"theorem","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-standard-model/strand-twist-datum.lean#L90-L102","doc":"**The framing is independent data over the braid word**: over any\nfixed word (hence fixed writhe) there exist framings with distinct\ntotal twist — the zero framing and a unit twist on the first strand.\nThis exhibits the writhe-degenerate separation that\n`sm-hypercharge-invariant` proves any hypercharge invariant needs. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.TwistDatum.totalTwist_bar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.TwistDatum.totalTwist_bar","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-standard-model/strand-twist-datum.lean#L84-L88","doc":"**Bar negation**: the conjugate framing has opposite total twist. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.TwistDatum.twistMultiset_perm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.TwistDatum.twistMultiset_perm","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-standard-model/strand-twist-datum.lean#L71-L82","doc":"**Gauge invariance of the twist multiset**: strand relabelling fixes\nthe multiset of twists. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.TwistDatum.totalTwist_perm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.TwistDatum.totalTwist_perm","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-standard-model/strand-twist-datum.lean#L65-L69","doc":"**Gauge invariance of the total twist**: strand relabelling fixes\n`T`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.TwistDatum.bar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.TwistDatum.bar","kind":"def","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-standard-model/strand-twist-datum.lean#L61-L63","doc":"The bar involution on framings: orientation reversal negates every\ntwist (antiparticle datum). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.TwistDatum.twistMultiset","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.TwistDatum.twistMultiset","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-standard-model/strand-twist-datum.lean#L57-L59","doc":"The twist multiset — the full gauge-orbit invariant. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.TwistDatum.totalTwist","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.TwistDatum.totalTwist","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-standard-model/strand-twist-datum.lean#L54-L55","doc":"The total twist `T(t) = Σᵢ tᵢ` — the candidate charge numerator. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.TwistDatum.perm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.TwistDatum.perm","kind":"def","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-standard-model/strand-twist-datum.lean#L50-L52","doc":"Strand relabelling: the residual `S_n` gauge action on the datum. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.TwistDatum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.TwistDatum","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-standard-model/strand-twist-datum.lean#L44-L46","doc":"**Per-strand framing (twist) datum** on an `n`-strand state: an\ninteger ribbon twist for each strand. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:strand-twist-datum","label":"def:strand-twist-datum","md":"quantum-observable-universe/appendix-standard-model/strand-twist-datum.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}